-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 1ב', §1.28 הפסקת עבודה
-- The end of a teaching employee's service: resignation (1.28.1), dismissal —
-- its procedure, the right to severance pay, its amount and when it is due,
-- and service under Jordan or old Jerusalem (1.28.2) — temporary suspension
-- (1.28.3) and abandoning the workplace (1.28.4).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

@desc The actors of section 1.28: the takanon's shared parties, and the bodies this section names that the shared list lacks.
DECLARE `1.28 party` IS ONE OF
    `takanon party` HAS `the shared party` IS A Party
    `the minister of education`
    `the minister of labour`
    `the director of the Arab education division`
    `the director of the Shelach department`
    `the teaching personnel division`
    `the appeals committee`
    `the higher parity committee`
    `the regional labour court`
    `the provident fund`
    `the employer's successor`

`the teacher`           MEANS `takanon party` `the teaching employee`
`the employer`          MEANS `takanon party` `the employer`
`the ownership`         MEANS `takanon party` `the local authority or owning body`
`the district manager`  MEANS `takanon party` `the district manager`
`the director-general`  MEANS `takanon party` `the director-general`
`the principal`         MEANS `takanon party` `the school principal`

-- Dates inside a year are days of the calendar year (1 January = 1, a
-- common year); dates across years are year-month-day numbers (19640101).
`10 April` MEANS 100
`31 May`   MEANS 151
`30 June`  MEANS 181

@desc What a party does under section 1.28.
DECLARE `termination action` IS ONE OF
    `give notice of resignation`  HAS `resignation notice month` IS A NUMBER
    `send a director-general warning` HAS `warning day` IS A NUMBER
    `give notice of dismissal`    HAS `dismissal notice day` IS A NUMBER
    `ask the union to convene a parity committee`
    `send a copy to the individual-care unit`
    `appoint the union's representatives`
    `forward the file, protocol and recommendation`
    `forward the appeal with the personal file`
    `recommend on the appeal`
    `give an opinion on the recommendation`
    `answer the appellant`
    `appeal the reduced position` HAS `reduction appeal day` IS A NUMBER
    `open talks with the teachers' unions` HAS `talks day` IS A NUMBER
    `pay severance` HAS `severance paid` IS A NUMBER
    `deposit severance savings` HAS `deposit day` IS A NUMBER
    `offer to renew the contract` HAS `renewal offer day` IS A NUMBER
    `dismiss without the minister of labour's permit`
    `suspend the teacher for pedagogical reasons`

§ `1.28 הפסקת עבודה`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28/p2 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28/p3 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28/p4 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28/p5 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28/p6 The page's table of contents: the headings of 1.28.1-1.28.4, which carry no rule of their own.

§§ `1.28.1 התפטרות`

@desc The ways a teaching employee's service ends (1.28.2.1 lists them; 1.28.1 is the first).
DECLARE `way of leaving` IS ONE OF
    `resignation`
    `dismissal`
    `retirement on pension`
    `death`

-- 1.28.1.1: a resignation earns severance only in the special cases of the
-- Severance Pay Law that 1.28.2 lists (1.28.2.2, "resignation that counts as
-- dismissal"); `resignation counts as dismissal` below is that list.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_1__para_1
GIVEN w IS A `way of leaving`, `a special case of 1.28.2 applies` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `leaving earns severance pay` w `a special case of 1.28.2 applies` IF
    CONSIDER w
    WHEN `resignation` THEN `a special case of 1.28.2 applies`
    WHEN `dismissal`   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `death`       THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE `a special case of 1.28.2 applies`

-- 1.28.1.2-1.28.1.3: notice at least two months before the day work is to
-- stop; time in months. Without that notice the teacher is regarded as
-- meaning to continue — the LEST below.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_1__para_2
GIVEN `month work is to stop` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.28 party` `termination action`
DECIDE `notice of resignation` `month work is to stop` IS
    PARTY `the teacher`
    MUST  `give notice of resignation` m PROVIDED m AT MOST `month work is to stop` MINUS 2
    WITHIN `month work is to stop` MINUS 2
    LEST  FULFILLED

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_1__para_3
GIVEN `months of notice given` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the teacher is regarded as continuing` `months of notice given` IF
    `months of notice given` LESS THAN 2

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_1__para_4
GIVEN `there is a disagreement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `goes to a parity committee of the ownership and the teacher` `there is a disagreement` IF
    `there is a disagreement`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_1/p1 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_1/p2 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_1/p3 The sources of 1.28.1 (אסמכתא): the 1943 work code for elementary-school teachers and a 1972 letter.

§§ `1.28.2.1 תהליך הפיטורין`

-- 1.28.2.1 ¶1-¶6: the four ways of leaving (the enum above); this chapter
-- deals with the second, dismissal.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p1
`the ways of leaving` MEANS
    LIST
        -- 1. resignation
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p2
        `resignation`,
        -- 2. dismissal
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p3
        `dismissal`,
        -- 3. retirement on pension
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p4
        `retirement on pension`,
        -- 4. death
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p5
        `death`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p6
`the way of leaving this chapter governs` MEANS `dismissal`

-- 1.28.2.1 ¶7-¶12: dismissal procedures differ by stage of education, and
-- each stage's procedure is in its own section of the takanon.
DECLARE `stage of education` IS ONE OF
    `kindergarten`
    `primary`
    `middle school`
    `post-primary`
    `management posts`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p7
GIVEN s IS A `stage of education`
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
DECIDE `the takanon sections on dismissal at` s IS
    CONSIDER s
    -- kindergarten teachers: 2.1.5
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p8
    WHEN `kindergarten`      THEN LIST "2.1.5"
    -- primary education: 3.5
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p9
    WHEN `primary`           THEN LIST "3.5"
    -- middle schools: 5.5
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p10
    WHEN `middle school`     THEN LIST "5.5"
    -- post-primary education: 6.5
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p11
    WHEN `post-primary`      THEN LIST "6.5"
    -- management posts: 7.3.4 and 7.6.4
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p12
    WHEN `management posts`  THEN LIST "7.3.4", "7.6.4"

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p13 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p14 Introduction to the provisions common to the whole system, and the heading "א. מי מוסמך לפטר"; the rules follow.

@desc The facts that decide who may sign a dismissal (1.28.2.1א).
DECLARE `dismissal case` HAS
    `the teacher is a state employee of the ministry` IS A BOOLEAN
    `for pedagogical reasons`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `the teacher is a Gadna instructor employed by the ministry` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in the Arab education system`           IS A BOOLEAN

-- 1.28.2.1א(1)-(4): the principal may not dismiss; for state employees the
-- minister (or his delegate) may, and by delegation the director-general
-- (pedagogical grounds), the director of Shelach (Gadna instructors), and
-- the director-general or the director of the Arab education division
-- (pedagogical grounds in Arab education); otherwise the employer.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p15
GIVEN c IS A `dismissal case`, signer IS A `1.28 party`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may sign the dismissal` c signer IF
    IF c's `the teacher is a state employee of the ministry`
    THEN    signer EQUALS `the minister of education`
        -- the director-general, by delegation, on pedagogical grounds
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p16
        OR  (signer EQUALS `the director-general` AND c's `for pedagogical reasons`)
        -- the director of Shelach, by delegation, for Gadna instructors
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p17
        OR  (signer EQUALS `the director of the Shelach department` AND c's `the teacher is a Gadna instructor employed by the ministry`)
        -- the director of Arab education, by delegation, on pedagogical grounds in Arab education
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p18
        OR  (signer EQUALS `the director of the Arab education division` AND c's `in the Arab education system` AND c's `for pedagogical reasons`)
    ELSE signer EQUALS `the employer`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p15
GIVEN c IS A `dismissal case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the principal may dismiss` c IF FALSE

-- 1.28.2.1א(4): what the Arab-education delegation covers.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p19
DECLARE `act under the Arab-education delegation` IS ONE OF
    -- (א) signing pedagogical dismissal letters
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p20
    `signing a pedagogical dismissal letter`
    -- (ב) signing pedagogical dismissal letters that entail a pension
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p21
    `signing a pedagogical dismissal letter that entails a pension`
    -- (ג) signing a warning letter
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p22
    `signing a warning letter`
    -- (ד) signing the stop of the post-warning process after the work improved
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p23
    `signing a notice ending the post-warning process`
    -- (ה) signing approval, in the minister's name, of the appeals committee's recommendations
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p24
    `signing approval of the appeals committee's recommendations`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p25 Heading "ב. מועד אחרון למשלוח אזהרות מנכ\"ל"; its rule follows.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p26
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.28 party` `termination action`
DECIDE `the last day for a director-general warning` IS
    PARTY `the director-general`
    MAY   `send a director-general warning` d PROVIDED d AT MOST `30 June`
    WITHIN `30 June`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p27 Heading "ג. מועד אחרון לפיטורין"; its rule follows.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p28
GIVEN s IS A `stage of education`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `31 May is the last day for dismissal at` s IF
    CONSIDER s
    WHEN `primary`      THEN TRUE
    WHEN `post-primary` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p28
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.28 party` `termination action`
DECIDE `the last day for a dismissal` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MAY   `give notice of dismissal` d PROVIDED d AT MOST `31 May`
    WITHIN `31 May`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p29
GIVEN `the employee is temporary` IS A BOOLEAN, `the notice is in writing` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a notice ending a temporary employee's work is valid` `the employee is temporary` `the notice is in writing` IF
    (NOT `the employee is temporary`) OR `the notice is in writing`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p30 Heading "ד. ועדות פריטטיות"; its rules follow.

-- 1.28.2.1ד(1): the parity committees implement the consultation with the
-- workers' committee (civil-service regulations, 82.233); they are not the
-- only forum with the unions and bar nothing else.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p31 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p32
`the parity committee is the only forum for talks with the unions` MEANS FALSE

@desc Why a district manager may move to end a teacher's service (1.28.2.1ד(2)).
DECLARE `ground for ending service` HAS
    `the teacher is permanent`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `the teacher is on probation`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `received a director-general warning`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `an urgent reason in the manager's discretion` IS A BOOLEAN
    `administrative reasons such as cuts`       IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p33
GIVEN g IS A `ground for ending service`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the district manager initiates a parity committee` g IF
        (g's `the teacher is permanent` AND g's `received a director-general warning`)
    OR  ((g's `the teacher is permanent` OR g's `the teacher is on probation`) AND g's `an urgent reason in the manager's discretion`)
    OR  ((g's `the teacher is permanent` OR g's `the teacher is on probation`) AND g's `administrative reasons such as cuts`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p33
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.28 party` `termination action`
DECIDE `convening a parity committee` IS
         (PARTY `the district manager`
          MUST  `ask the union to convene a parity committee`
          HENCE (PARTY `takanon party` `the teachers' union` MUST `appoint the union's representatives`))
    RAND (PARTY `the district manager` MUST `send a copy to the individual-care unit`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p34
DECLARE `parity committee` HAS
    -- two for the ministry: the district manager or deputy (chair) and a supervisor
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p35
    `ministry representatives`              IS A NUMBER
    `chaired by the district manager or the deputy` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a supervisor of the institution or another supervisor sits` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- two for the teacher's union, appointed by its secretary-general
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p36
    `union representatives`                 IS A NUMBER
    -- the teacher is heard, then asked to leave
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p37
    `the teacher was heard and then left`   IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p34
GIVEN c IS A `parity committee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the parity committee is properly composed` c IF
        c's `ministry representatives` EQUALS 2
    AND c's `chaired by the district manager or the deputy`
    AND c's `a supervisor of the institution or another supervisor sits`
    AND c's `union representatives` EQUALS 2
    AND c's `the teacher was heard and then left`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p38
DECLARE `parity protocol` HAS
    `detailed, with conclusions and recommendations` IS A BOOLEAN
    `worded unequivocally`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `signed by every member`               IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN p IS A `parity protocol`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the protocol is in order` p IF
    p's `detailed, with conclusions and recommendations` AND p's `worded unequivocally` AND p's `signed by every member`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p39
GIVEN `the teacher is in state-religious education` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF `1.28 party`
DECIDE `who signs the district recommendation` `the teacher is in state-religious education` IS
    IF `the teacher is in state-religious education`
    THEN LIST `the district manager`, `takanon party` `the supervisor`
    ELSE LIST `the district manager`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p39
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.28 party` `termination action`
DECIDE `after the parity committee` IS
    PARTY `the district manager`
    MUST  `forward the file, protocol and recommendation`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p40
GIVEN `the committee reached a conclusion` IS A BOOLEAN, `the dismissal was made by 31 May` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `goes to a higher parity committee` `the committee reached a conclusion` `the dismissal was made by 31 May` IF
    (NOT `the committee reached a conclusion`) AND `the dismissal was made by 31 May`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p41
GIVETH A `1.28 party`
DECIDE `who may approve enlarged severance` IS `takanon party` `the Civil Service Commission`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p41
`the parity representatives may recommend enlarged severance in a covering letter` MEANS TRUE

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p42 Heading "ה. נוהל טיפול בערעורים על פיטורין"; its rule follows.

-- 1.28.2.1ה(1)-(4): an appeal received by the minister or the
-- director-general goes through the teaching personnel division, with the
-- personal file, to the appeals committee; its written recommendation goes
-- back through the division, which adds its opinion; the answer comes from
-- whoever the appeal was addressed to, through the division, with a copy to
-- the district manager.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p43 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p44 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p45 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p46
GIVEN `addressed to` IS A `1.28 party`
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.28 party` `termination action`
DECIDE `an appeal against a dismissal` `addressed to` IS
    PARTY `the teaching personnel division`
    MUST  `forward the appeal with the personal file`
    HENCE (PARTY `the appeals committee`
           MUST  `recommend on the appeal`
           HENCE (PARTY `the teaching personnel division`
                  MUST  `give an opinion on the recommendation`
                  HENCE (PARTY `addressed to` MUST `answer the appellant`)))

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p47 Heading "ו. הקטנת היקף המשרה"; its rules follow.

-- 1.28.2.1ו(1): an appeal against too few hours within two weeks of the
-- first reduced salary keeps the completion from the start; a late appeal
-- earns the completion only from the day of the application.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p48
GIVEN `days from the first reduced salary to the appeal` IS A NUMBER, `day of the reduction` IS A NUMBER, `day of the appeal` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `hours are completed from day` `days from the first reduced salary to the appeal` `day of the reduction` `day of the appeal` IS
    IF `days from the first reduced salary to the appeal` AT MOST 14
    THEN `day of the reduction`
    ELSE `day of the appeal`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p49
GIVEN `employment relationship severed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a reduced position earns severance` `employment relationship severed` IF
    `employment relationship severed`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p50 Heading "ז. סגירת בית-הספר או צמצום היקף העבודה בו"; its rule follows.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p51
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.28 party` `termination action`
DECIDE `talks before closing a school` IS
    PARTY `the ownership`
    MUST  `open talks with the teachers' unions` d PROVIDED d AT MOST `31 May`
    WITHIN `31 May`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the ownership` BECAUSE "1.28.2.1ז: talks with the teachers' unions may not be put off past 31 May"

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p51
GIVEN `day of the talks` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the talks were near the end of registration` `day of the talks` IF
    `day of the talks` AT MOST `10 April`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p52 Heading "ח. שיבה לעבודה"; its rules follow.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p53
GIVEN `dismissed pedagogically from another sector` IS A BOOLEAN, `special reasons` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be returned to work in this sector` `dismissed pedagogically from another sector` `special reasons` IF
    (NOT `dismissed pedagogically from another sector`) OR `special reasons`

-- 1.28.2.1ח(2) and 1.28.2.2 ¶32 (the same sentence again): after three
-- months from the dismissal there is neither a legal bar to employing again
-- one who left with severance pay, nor a legal duty to.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p54 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p32
GIVEN `months since the dismissal` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `there is no legal bar to rehiring one who took severance` `months since the dismissal` IF
    `months since the dismissal` AT LEAST 3

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p54 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p32
`there is a legal duty to rehire one who took severance` MEANS FALSE

-- 1.28.2.1ח(2) ¶2: the request goes on the form, through the district
-- manager, who gives an opinion and comments "on his very decision on the
-- shortening" — read under F-1.28-d.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p55
DECLARE `district manager's comment on a return request` IS ONE OF
    `an opinion on the request`
    `comments on the decision that ended the service`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p55
`the decisions 1.28.2.1ח provides for` MEANS
    LIST "dismissal (the decision that ended the service)", "the opinion on the return request"

`the term "the shortening" names a decision the text provides for` MEANS
    elem "a shortening of the three-month wait" `the decisions 1.28.2.1ח provides for`

-- F-1.28-d: the text provides for no shortening.
`"the shortening" is undefined in 1.28.2.1ח` MEANS
    NOT `the term "the shortening" names a decision the text provides for`
#ASSERT `"the shortening" is undefined in 1.28.2.1ח`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p56 Heading "ט. הגבלת פיטורין"; its rules follow.

@desc A dismissal the Women's Employment Law restricts (1.28.2.1ט).
DECLARE `protected situation` HAS
    `pregnant and not yet on maternity leave`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `months with this employer`                 IS A NUMBER
    `the minister thinks the dismissal is connected to the pregnancy` IS A BOOLEAN
    `on maternity leave`                        IS A BOOLEAN
    `absent after maternity leave on a doctor's certificate, up to 6 months` IS A BOOLEAN
    `within 45 days after the leave or absence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `absent on extended leave to care for the baby` IS A BOOLEAN
    `within 45 days after the extended leave`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `absent for fertility treatment towards a first or second child` IS A BOOLEAN
    `within 150 days after that absence`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `has the minister of labour's permit`       IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p57
GIVEN p IS A `protected situation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a pregnant employee may not be dismissed` p IF
        p's `pregnant and not yet on maternity leave`
    AND p's `months with this employer` AT LEAST 6
    AND ((NOT p's `has the minister of labour's permit`) OR p's `the minister thinks the dismissal is connected to the pregnancy`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p57
`the end of a fixed-term contract counts as a dismissal for the pregnancy rule` MEANS TRUE

-- 1.28.2.1ט(2) names no permit: the bar is absolute.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p58
GIVEN p IS A `protected situation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may not be dismissed after the birth` p IF
        p's `on maternity leave`
    OR  p's `absent after maternity leave on a doctor's certificate, up to 6 months`
    OR  p's `within 45 days after the leave or absence`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p59
GIVEN p IS A `protected situation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may not be dismissed during the extended leave` p IF
        (p's `absent on extended leave to care for the baby` OR p's `within 45 days after the extended leave`)
    AND (NOT p's `has the minister of labour's permit`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p60
GIVEN p IS A `protected situation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may not be dismissed during fertility treatment` p IF
        (p's `absent for fertility treatment towards a first or second child` OR p's `within 150 days after that absence`)
    AND (NOT p's `has the minister of labour's permit`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p57 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p58 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p59 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p60
GIVEN p IS A `protected situation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the dismissal is barred` p IF
        `a pregnant employee may not be dismissed` p
    OR  `may not be dismissed after the birth` p
    OR  `may not be dismissed during the extended leave` p
    OR  `may not be dismissed during fertility treatment` p

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p61
`the special rule for a pregnant post-primary teacher is in section` MEANS "6.5"

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p62 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p63 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p64 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p65 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p66 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p67 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p68 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p69 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p70 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p71 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p72 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p73 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p74 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p75 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p76 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p77 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p78 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_1/p79 The sources of 1.28.2.1 (אסמכתא): circulars, government decisions, ministers' letters and the Women's Employment Law.

§§ `1.28.2.2 זכאות לפיצויי פיטורין`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p1 Heading "עובד מפוטר"; its rules follow.

@desc A teaching employee's service, as far as the right to severance asks about it.
DECLARE `service record` HAS
    `years of continuous work with the employer` IS A NUMBER
    `is a seasonal worker`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `seasons worked in two consecutive years` IS A NUMBER
    `was dismissed`                           IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p2
GIVEN s IS A `service record`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a dismissed employee is entitled to severance` s IF
        s's `was dismissed`
    AND (IF s's `is a seasonal worker`
         THEN s's `seasons worked in two consecutive years` AT LEAST 2
         ELSE s's `years of continuous work with the employer` AT LEAST 1)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p2
GIVEN `consecutive months` IS A NUMBER, `days worked in them` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is a season` `consecutive months` `days worked in them` IF
    `consecutive months` EQUALS 3 AND `days worked in them` AT LEAST 60

-- 1.28.2.2 ¶3: on a change of employers, the former employer pays as if it
-- had dismissed on the day of the change, unless the new employer took the
-- liability on in writing — then the earlier service counts with the new one.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p3
GIVEN `the new employer undertook the liability in writing` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `1.28 party`
DECIDE `who owes severance for the service before a change of employers` `the new employer undertook the liability in writing` IS
    IF `the new employer undertook the liability in writing`
    THEN `the employer's successor`
    ELSE `the employer`

@desc The breaks in work that do not break its continuity (1.28.2.2, item 2).
DECLARE `break in work` IS ONE OF
    `military service or partial service`
    `full service under a career undertaking that failed its conditions`
    `reserve duty or service by order`
    `weekly rest, a holiday not worked, or 1 May`
    `annual leave`
    `paid leave or vacation`
    `unpaid leave or vacation`
    `strike or lockout`
    `accident or illness`
    `days of mourning not worked`
    `a temporary break without severing the relationship`
    `a break severing the relationship`
    `training for emergency labour service`
    `another break`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p4
GIVEN b IS A `break in work`, `months of a severing break` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the break keeps continuity` b `months of a severing break` IF
    CONSIDER b
    -- (א) military and partial service, reserve duty and service by order — save full career service that failed its conditions
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p5
    WHEN `military service or partial service` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `reserve duty or service by order` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `full service under a career undertaking that failed its conditions` THEN FALSE
    -- (ב) the weekly rest day, a holiday not worked, and 1 May
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p6
    WHEN `weekly rest, a holiday not worked, or 1 May` THEN TRUE
    -- (ג) annual leave
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p7
    WHEN `annual leave` THEN TRUE
    -- (ד) paid leave or vacation by law or with the employer's consent
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p8
    WHEN `paid leave or vacation` THEN TRUE
    -- (ה) unpaid leave or vacation by law or with the employer's consent
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p9
    WHEN `unpaid leave or vacation` THEN TRUE
    -- (ו) a strike or lockout
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p10
    WHEN `strike or lockout` THEN TRUE
    -- (ז) accident or illness
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p11
    WHEN `accident or illness` THEN TRUE
    -- (ח) days of mourning not worked for reasons of religion or custom
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p12
    WHEN `days of mourning not worked` THEN TRUE
    -- (ט) a temporary break without severing, or a severing break of up to 3 months
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p13
    WHEN `a temporary break without severing the relationship` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a break severing the relationship` THEN `months of a severing break` AT MOST 3
    -- (י) training for emergency labour service
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p14
    WHEN `training for emergency labour service` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p15
GIVEN `dismissed near the end of the first year` IS A BOOLEAN, `the contrary was proved` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the dismissal is presumed to dodge severance` `dismissed near the end of the first year` `the contrary was proved` IF
    `dismissed near the end of the first year` AND (NOT `the contrary was proved`)

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p16 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p17 Headings "עובד מתפטר שדינו כעובד מפוטר" and "1. התפטרות לרגל מצב בריאות לקוי"; their rules follow.

@desc A family member for the health ground (1.28.2.2, resignation 1).
DECLARE `relative` IS ONE OF
    `spouse, including a reputed spouse`
    `child, including adopted or step`
    `parent`
    `grandchild, grandparent or parent-in-law`
    `other relative`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p19
GIVEN r IS A `relative`, `lives with the employee and is mainly supported by him` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is a family member` r `lives with the employee and is mainly supported by him` IF
    CONSIDER r
    -- (א) the spouse, a reputed spouse included
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p20
    WHEN `spouse, including a reputed spouse` THEN TRUE
    -- (ב) a child, adopted or step-child included
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p21
    WHEN `child, including adopted or step` THEN TRUE
    -- (ג) a parent
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p22
    WHEN `parent` THEN TRUE
    -- (ד) a grandchild, grandparent or parent-in-law living with the employee and mainly supported by him
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p23
    WHEN `grandchild, grandparent or parent-in-law` THEN `lives with the employee and is mainly supported by him`
    OTHERWISE FALSE

@desc The facts that make a resignation count as a dismissal (1.28.2.2).
DECLARE `resignation case` HAS
    `for the health of the employee or a family member` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the findings and conditions gave sufficient cause` IS A BOOLEAN
    `months since the birth or adoption`     IS A NUMBER
    `to care for the child`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `adoption order given before or after`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `is the father or adoptive father`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `the spouse worked 6 consecutive months just before` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the child is in his sole care for the spouse's disability or illness` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the other spouse already resigned on this ground` IS A BOOLEAN
    `moved home`                             IS A BOOLEAN
    `relocation ground`                      IS A `relocation ground`
    `contract ended without an offer to renew` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a material worsening of conditions or circumstances making continuing unreasonable` IS A BOOLEAN
    `seasonal, after 3 consecutive seasons without assured continuous work` IS A BOOLEAN
    `just before enlisting for regular service, because of it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `elected head or deputy head of a local authority, salaried` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the employer agreed in writing to count the term as unpaid leave` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a woman`                             IS A BOOLEAN
    `age`                                    IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p18
GIVEN c IS A `resignation case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a health resignation counts as dismissal` c IF
    c's `for the health of the employee or a family member` AND c's `the findings and conditions gave sufficient cause`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p24 Heading "2. (א) התפטרות אם"; its rule follows.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p25
GIVEN c IS A `resignation case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a parent's resignation counts as dismissal` c IF
        c's `to care for the child`
    AND c's `months since the birth or adoption` LESS THAN 9
    AND c's `adoption order given before or after`
    AND (NOT c's `the other spouse already resigned on this ground`)
    AND ((NOT c's `is the father or adoptive father`)
         -- (1) the father's spouse worked six consecutive months just before his resignation
         @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p26
         OR c's `the spouse worked 6 consecutive months just before`
         -- (2) or the child is in his sole care because of the spouse's disability or illness
         @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p27
         OR c's `the child is in his sole care for the spouse's disability or illness`)

-- `adoption order given before or after` is TRUE for a birth: the order is
-- a condition of the adoption case only.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p28
`only one spouse may resign on the parent ground` MEANS TRUE

-- 1.28.2.2, 2(ב): a teacher who came back after the 12 weeks of maternity
-- pay keeps the right if she resigns at the end of that school year, when
-- more than one and less than two years have passed since the birth.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p29
GIVEN `returned after the 12 weeks` IS A BOOLEAN, `resigns at the end of the school year` IS A BOOLEAN, `months since the birth` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a returning mother keeps the right to severance` `returned after the 12 weeks` `resigns at the end of the school year` `months since the birth` IF
        `returned after the 12 weeks`
    AND `resigns at the end of the school year`
    AND `months since the birth` GREATER THAN 12
    AND `months since the birth` LESS THAN 24

-- Her two notices: the first a month before the first anniversary of the
-- birth (time in months from the birth); the second at the district office
-- by the end of the school year, 30 June (time in days of the year).
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p30
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.28 party` `termination action`
DECIDE `a returning mother's first notice` IS
    PARTY `the teacher`
    MUST  `give notice of resignation` m PROVIDED m AT MOST 11
    WITHIN 11

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p31
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.28 party` `termination action`
DECIDE `a returning mother's second notice` IS
    PARTY `the teacher`
    MUST  `give notice of resignation` d PROVIDED d AT MOST `30 June`
    WITHIN `30 June`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p33 Heading "3. התפטרוּת לרגל העתקת מקום מגורים"; its rules follow.

@desc The grounds of a move of home that make a resignation count as dismissal (1.28.2.2, 3).
DECLARE `relocation ground` IS ONE OF
    `no relocation ground`
    `marriage, to the spouse's town`
    `to an agricultural or development town`
    `a career-army spouse's posting`
    `to an approved settlement or outpost`
    `a police or prison-service spouse's posting`
    `joining a spouse on a national mission abroad`
    `divorce`

@desc The facts of a move of home.
DECLARE `move of home` HAS
    `ground`                                  IS A `relocation ground`
    `km between the old and the new home`     IS A NUMBER
    `the new home is farther from work`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `months lived in the new place`           IS A NUMBER
    `resigned meaning to settle there`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `the place is on the linked list`         IS A BOOLEAN @desc the development towns, or the settlements and outposts the ministers approved: lists the source page links (table_09, table_10) and the corpus does not reproduce; an input
    `the mission lasts over 6 months`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `the employer refused unpaid leave for the mission` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p34
GIVEN m IS A `move of home`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a move of home makes the resignation a dismissal` m IF
    CONSIDER m's `ground`
    -- (א) marriage: 40 km at least, and the new home farther from work
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p35 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p36
    WHEN `marriage, to the spouse's town` THEN
        m's `km between the old and the new home` AT LEAST 40 AND m's `the new home is farther from work`
    -- (ב) to an agricultural or development town, read under F-1.28-c
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p37 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p38 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p39 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p40
    WHEN `to an agricultural or development town` THEN
        `the conditions of a move to an agricultural or development town` m
    -- (ג)(1) a career-army spouse's posting: 40 km, farther from work
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p41
    WHEN `a career-army spouse's posting` THEN
        m's `km between the old and the new home` AT LEAST 40 AND m's `the new home is farther from work`
    -- (ג)(2) an approved settlement or outpost, lived in 6 consecutive months
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p42 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p43
    WHEN `to an approved settlement or outpost` THEN
        m's `the place is on the linked list` AND m's `months lived in the new place` AT LEAST 6
    -- (ג)(3) a police or prison-service spouse's posting: 40 km, farther from work
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p44
    WHEN `a police or prison-service spouse's posting` THEN
        m's `km between the old and the new home` AT LEAST 40 AND m's `the new home is farther from work`
    -- (ג)(4) joining a spouse on a national mission abroad over 6 months, unpaid leave refused
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p45
    WHEN `joining a spouse on a national mission abroad` THEN
        m's `the mission lasts over 6 months` AND m's `the employer refused unpaid leave for the mission`
    -- (ג)(5) divorce: 40 km, lived there 6 months
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p46
    WHEN `divorce` THEN
        m's `km between the old and the new home` AT LEAST 40 AND m's `months lived in the new place` AT LEAST 6
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- (ב)'s two conditions, "1. אם … 2. אם …", read as both required (F-1.28-c).
GIVEN m IS A `move of home`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the conditions of a move to an agricultural or development town` m IF
        m's `the place is on the linked list`
    AND m's `months lived in the new place` AT LEAST 6
    AND m's `resigned meaning to settle there`

GIVEN m IS A `move of home`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the conditions of a move to an agricultural or development town, read as alternatives` m IF
        m's `the place is on the linked list`
    AND (m's `months lived in the new place` AT LEAST 6 OR m's `resigned meaning to settle there`)

`a move to settle, three months in` MEANS
    `move of home` WITH
        `ground`                                  IS `to an agricultural or development town`
        `km between the old and the new home`     IS 25
        `the new home is farther from work`       IS TRUE
        `months lived in the new place`           IS 3
        `resigned meaning to settle there`        IS TRUE
        `the place is on the linked list`         IS TRUE
        `the mission lasts over 6 months`         IS FALSE
        `the employer refused unpaid leave for the mission` IS FALSE

-- F-1.28-c: the two readings of (ב) differ for one who resigned to settle
-- and has lived there less than six months.
`the readings of the move to an agricultural or development town differ` MEANS
    NOT (`the conditions of a move to an agricultural or development town` `a move to settle, three months in`
         EQUALS `the conditions of a move to an agricultural or development town, read as alternatives` `a move to settle, three months in`)
#ASSERT `the readings of the move to an agricultural or development town differ`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p47 Heading "3. אי-חידוש חוזה עבודה"; its rules follow.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p48
DECLARE `end of a fixed-term contract` IS ONE OF
    `ended, no renewal offered`
    `ended, renewal offered and refused`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p48
GIVEN e IS A `end of a fixed-term contract`
GIVETH A `way of leaving`
DECIDE `the end of the contract is treated as` e IS
    CONSIDER e
    WHEN `ended, no renewal offered` THEN `dismissal`
    WHEN `ended, renewal offered and refused` THEN `resignation`

-- 1.28.2.2, 3(ב): the offer to renew must reach the employee at least three
-- months before the contract ends (time in months from the start of the
-- contract's last year, which ends at month 12).
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p49
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.28 party` `termination action`
DECIDE `an offer to renew in time` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MAY   `offer to renew the contract` m PROVIDED m AT MOST 9
    WITHIN 9

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p50 Heading "4. התפטרות אחרת שדינה כפיטורין"; its rules follow.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p51
GIVEN c IS A `resignation case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a resignation over worse conditions counts as dismissal` c IF
    c's `a material worsening of conditions or circumstances making continuing unreasonable`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p52
GIVEN c IS A `resignation case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a seasonal worker's resignation counts as dismissal` c IF
    c's `seasonal, after 3 consecutive seasons without assured continuous work`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p53
GIVEN c IS A `resignation case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a resignation to enlist counts as dismissal` c IF
    c's `just before enlisting for regular service, because of it`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p54
GIVEN c IS A `resignation case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a resignation on election as head of a local authority counts as dismissal` c IF
    c's `elected head or deputy head of a local authority, salaried`
    AND (NOT c's `the employer agreed in writing to count the term as unpaid leave`)

-- 1.28.2.2, 4(ה): a woman of 60 or a man of 65 who resigns. What a provident
-- fund pays out of the employer's contributions may be set off against it.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p55
GIVEN c IS A `resignation case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a resignation at pension age counts as dismissal` c IF
    IF c's `is a woman` THEN c's `age` AT LEAST 60 ELSE c's `age` AT LEAST 65

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p55
GIVEN `severance due` IS A NUMBER, `paid by a provident fund from the employer's contributions` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `left for the employer to pay at pension age` `severance due` `paid by a provident fund from the employer's contributions` IS
    max 0 (`severance due` MINUS `paid by a provident fund from the employer's contributions`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p18 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p25 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p34 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p51
GIVEN c IS A `resignation case`, m IS A `move of home`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the resignation counts as dismissal` c m IF
        `a health resignation counts as dismissal` c
    OR  `a parent's resignation counts as dismissal` c
    OR  (c's `moved home` AND `a move of home makes the resignation a dismissal` m)
    OR  `a resignation over worse conditions counts as dismissal` c
    OR  `a seasonal worker's resignation counts as dismissal` c
    OR  `a resignation to enlist counts as dismissal` c
    OR  `a resignation on election as head of a local authority counts as dismissal` c
    OR  `a resignation at pension age counts as dismissal` c

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p56 Heading "5. פיצויים למתגייס למשטרה"; its rule follows.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p57
GIVEN `resigned to enlist in the police or prison service` IS A BOOLEAN, `months served` IS A NUMBER, `service ended on a severance ground` IS A BOOLEAN, `service ended as unsuited, in circumstances earning police retirement pay` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a police recruit or his survivors are entitled` `resigned to enlist in the police or prison service` `months served` `service ended on a severance ground` `service ended as unsuited, in circumstances earning police retirement pay` IF
    `resigned to enlist in the police or prison service`
    AND (
            -- (א) served six months at least
            @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p58
            `months served` AT LEAST 6
            -- (ב) the service ended on a ground that earns severance
            @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p59
         OR `service ended on a severance ground`
            -- (ג) ended as unsuited, unless in circumstances that would not earn police retirement pay
            @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p60
         OR `service ended as unsuited, in circumstances earning police retirement pay`)

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p61 Heading "6. מעביד שנפטר"; its rule follows.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p62
DECLARE `end of the employer` IS ONE OF
    `the employer died`
    `the employer went bankrupt`
    `the corporation was wound up or struck off`
    `the employer continues`

GIVEN e IS A `end of the employer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the work ending with the employer earns severance as a dismissal` e IF
    CONSIDER e
    WHEN `the employer continues` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p63 Heading "7. עובד שנפטר"; its rules follow.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p64 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p65
DECLARE `survivor` IS ONE OF
    `the spouse at death, a reputed spouse living with him included`
    `a dependent child under the National Insurance Law`
    `a child or parent mainly supported by the deceased`
    `a sibling who lived in his home 12 months before and was wholly supported`
    `someone else`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p65
GIVEN s IS A `survivor`, `there is a spouse or dependent child` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is a survivor entitled to the severance` s `there is a spouse or dependent child` IF
    CONSIDER s
    WHEN `the spouse at death, a reputed spouse living with him included` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a dependent child under the National Insurance Law` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a child or parent mainly supported by the deceased` THEN NOT `there is a spouse or dependent child`
    WHEN `a sibling who lived in his home 12 months before and was wholly supported` THEN NOT `there is a spouse or dependent child`
    OTHERWISE FALSE

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p66
GIVEN s IS A `survivor`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the severance is deposited in the regional labour court` s IF
    CONSIDER s
    WHEN `the spouse at death, a reputed spouse living with him included` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `a dependent child under the National Insurance Law` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p67
`severance paid to survivors is part of the estate` MEANS FALSE

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p68 Heading "8. פיצויי פיטורין בעד שירות מעל ל-35 שנה"; its rules follow.

@desc The periods 1.28.2.2, 8(2) counts towards the 35 years.
DECLARE `counted service period` IS ONE OF
    `permanent state service with pension rights`
    `temporary or special-contract service bought for pension`
    `other service for the state`
    `earlier service recognised for pension, at the recognised rate`
    `work under a pension-continuity agreement`
    `enlarged service`
    `other service`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p70 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p71
GIVEN p IS A `counted service period`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `counts towards the 35 years` p IF
    CONSIDER p
    -- (א) permanent state service with pension rights
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p72
    WHEN `permanent state service with pension rights` THEN TRUE
    -- (ב) temporary or special-contract service bought for pension
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p73
    WHEN `temporary or special-contract service bought for pension` THEN TRUE
    -- (ג) other service for the state: police, Knesset, army
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p74
    WHEN `other service for the state` THEN TRUE
    -- (ד) earlier service recognised for pension, at the rate recognised
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p75
    WHEN `earlier service recognised for pension, at the recognised rate` THEN TRUE
    -- (ה) work for another employer under a pension-continuity agreement
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p76
    WHEN `work under a pension-continuity agreement` THEN TRUE
    -- enlarged service is not counted
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p70
    WHEN `enlarged service` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p69 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p79
GIVEN `months of service counted` IS A NUMBER, `age at retirement` IS A NUMBER, `retirement date` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `months beyond 35 years` `months of service counted` `age at retirement` `retirement date` IS
    IF `age at retirement` AT LEAST 60 AND `retirement date` AT LEAST 19800401
    THEN max 0 (`months of service counted` MINUS 420)
    ELSE 0

-- 1.28.2.2, 8(3)-(4): 1/12 of the monthly salary for every month (and part
-- of a month) beyond 35 years. Clause 3 names both "the combined monthly
-- salary" and "the determining salary" as its base (F-1.28-e); the
-- determining salary, which clause 4 names alone, is the reading taken.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p77 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p78
GIVEN `months beyond` IS A NUMBER, `the last determining salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `severance for service beyond 35 years` `months beyond` `the last determining salary` IS
    `months beyond` TIMES `the last determining salary` DIVIDED BY 12

-- F-1.28-e: the two bases give different sums wherever the determining
-- salary (pension-recognised additions included) exceeds the combined one.
-- Placeholder figures: 60 months beyond, combined 10,000, determining 12,000.
`the two bases of 8(3) give different sums` MEANS
    NOT (`severance for service beyond 35 years` 60 10000 EQUALS `severance for service beyond 35 years` 60 12000)
#ASSERT `the two bases of 8(3) give different sums`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p80 Heading "9. פיטורין שאינם מזכים בתשלום פיצויים"; its rules follow.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p81
GIVEN `the governing collective agreement justifies dismissal without full severance` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `severance may be denied or cut` `the governing collective agreement justifies dismissal without full severance` IF
    `the governing collective agreement justifies dismissal without full severance`

@desc A dismissal for misconduct (1.28.2.2, 9 — the agreement for state employees).
DECLARE `misconduct dismissal` HAS
    `is permanent`                                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `convicted finally of a disgraceful offence of 3 years' imprisonment or more, tied to the service` IS A BOOLEAN
    `on probation or temporary`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `unfair conduct in or about the duties`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `conduct that may harm the civil service's image` IS A BOOLEAN
    `convicted of a disgraceful offence tied to the service` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the dismisser determined no or partial severance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the workers' committee was consulted`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `the employee was heard`                        IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p82
GIVEN d IS A `misconduct dismissal`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a state employee's severance may be denied or cut` d IF
        `a ground of 9(א) or 9(ב)` d
    AND d's `the dismisser determined no or partial severance`
    -- (ג) the determination only after consulting the workers' committee and hearing the employee
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p88
    AND d's `the workers' committee was consulted`
    AND d's `the employee was heard`

GIVEN d IS A `misconduct dismissal`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a ground of 9(א) or 9(ב)` d IF
    -- (א) a permanent employee convicted finally of a disgraceful offence of 3 years or more tied to the service
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p83
        (d's `is permanent` AND d's `convicted finally of a disgraceful offence of 3 years' imprisonment or more, tied to the service`)
    -- (ב) on probation or temporary, dismissed for one of these:
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p84
    OR  (d's `on probation or temporary` AND `a misconduct ground of 9(ב)` d)

GIVEN d IS A `misconduct dismissal`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a misconduct ground of 9(ב)` d IF
    -- (1) unfair conduct in or about the duties
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p85
        d's `unfair conduct in or about the duties`
    -- (2) conduct that may harm the image or good name of the civil service
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p86
    OR  d's `conduct that may harm the civil service's image`
    -- (3) a disgraceful offence tied to the service
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p87
    OR  d's `convicted of a disgraceful offence tied to the service`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p89
`these provisions detract from section 68 of the Civil Service (Discipline) Law` MEANS FALSE

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p90 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p91 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p92 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p93 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p94 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p95 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p96 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p97 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p98 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p99 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p100 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p101 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_2/p102 The sources of 1.28.2.2 (אסמכתא): sections of the Severance Pay Law 1963 (which note 16 names "the law", "החוק") and its regulations, collective agreements and circulars.

§§ `1.28.2.3 שיעור הפיצויים ומועד התשלום`

@desc An employee's pay for severance purposes.
DECLARE `severance basis` HAS
    `paid monthly`                    IS A BOOLEAN @desc "עובד במשכורת": the main pay is monthly or for a longer period; otherwise "עובד בשכר"
    `last monthly salary`             IS A NUMBER  @desc the last salary, from the components below; set by the collective agreement
    `last weekly wage`                IS A NUMBER
    `years after 1 January 1964`      IS A NUMBER  @desc years of counted service from 1 January 1964, a part of a year as a fraction
    `years before 1 January 1964`     IS A NUMBER
    `share of the last salary for the years before 1964` IS A NUMBER @desc the collective agreement's base for those years: 0.8 at least

-- 1.28.2.3, 1(א) and 3: a month's salary for a salaried employee, two
-- weeks' wage for a wage-earner, per year, a part of a year pro rata; the
-- years after 1.1.1964 on the last salary, the earlier ones on at least 80%.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p1 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p27
GIVEN b IS A `severance basis`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `severance pay` b IS
    `pay for a year` TIMES (b's `years after 1 January 1964`
                            PLUS b's `years before 1 January 1964` TIMES max (b's `share of the last salary for the years before 1964`) 0.8)
    WHERE
        `pay for a year` MEANS
            IF b's `paid monthly` THEN b's `last monthly salary` ELSE 2 TIMES b's `last weekly wage`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p2
`the minister of labour may raise a wage-earner's rate by regulations` MEANS TRUE

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p3 Heading "2. רכיבי השכר שיובאו בחשבון"; the list follows.

@desc A pay component counted in the last salary for severance, and the dates it counts between.
DECLARE `severance component` HAS
    `component name`   IS A STRING
    `counted from`     IS A NUMBER  @desc year-month-day; 0 where the text gives no start
    `counted until`    IS A NUMBER  @desc year-month-day; 99991231 where the text gives no end

`the components counted for severance` MEANS
    LIST
        -- (א) the combined salary
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p4
        `severance component` "combined salary (שכר משולב)" 0 99991231,
        -- (ב) the framework agreement
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p5
        `severance component` "framework agreement (הסכם מסגרת)" 0 99991231,
        -- (ג) class-education allowance
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p6
        `severance component` "class-education allowance (גמול חינוך כיתה)" 0 99991231,
        -- (ד) subject and training allowance
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p7
        `severance component` "subject and training allowance (גמול מקצוע והכשרות)" 0 99991231,
        -- (ה) further-training allowance
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p8
        `severance component` "further-training allowance (גמול השתלמות)" 0 99991231,
        -- (ו) supervision allowance
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p9
        `severance component` "supervision allowance (גמול פיקוח)" 0 99991231,
        -- (ז) management allowance
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p10
        `severance component` "management allowance (גמול ניהול)" 0 99991231,
        -- (ח) special-education allowance
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p11
        `severance component` "special-education allowance (גמול חינוך מיוחד)" 0 99991231,
        -- (ט) 1/12 of the annual recuperation allowance
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p12
        `severance component` "1/12 of the annual recuperation allowance" 0 99991231,
        -- (י) the 12% allowance of seminar teachers
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p13
        `severance component` "12% allowance for seminar teachers" 0 99991231,
        -- (יא) stay supplement, until 31.12.93
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p14
        `severance component` "stay supplement (תוספת שהייה)" 0 19931231,
        -- (יב) counselling allowance
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p15
        `severance component` "counselling allowance (גמול ייעוץ)" 0 99991231,
        -- (יג) teacher-instructor allowance
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p16
        `severance component` "teacher-instructor allowance (גמול מורה-מדריך)" 0 99991231,
        -- (יד) 1/12 of the clothing allowance, for budgetary-pension members only
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p17
        `severance component` "1/12 of the clothing allowance (budgetary pension only)" 0 99991231,
        -- (טו) the 2% supplement to the matriculation-preparation allowance
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p18
        `severance component` "2% supplement to the matriculation-preparation allowance" 0 99991231,
        -- (טז) school-based training supplement, until 31.8.94
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p19
        `severance component` "school-based training supplement" 0 19940831,
        -- (יז) teaching-reinforcement supplement, from 1.9.94
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p20
        `severance component` "teaching-reinforcement supplement (תוספת תגבור הוראה)" 19940901 99991231,
        -- (יח) MA and doctorate allowance
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p21
        `severance component` "MA and doctorate allowance" 0 99991231,
        -- (יט) allowance for first-grade class teachers
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p22
        `severance component` "first-grade class-teacher allowance" 0 99991231,
        -- (כ) the 1993 agreement supplement, until 31.12.93
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p23
        `severance component` "1993 agreement supplement (תוספת הסכם 1993)" 0 19931231,
        -- (כא) education allowance for class teachers of grades 7-9
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p24
        `severance component` "education allowance for class teachers of grades 7-9" 0 99991231

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p3
GIVEN `date of leaving` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
DECIDE `the components counted on` `date of leaving` IS
    map (GIVEN c YIELD c's `component name`)
        (filter (GIVEN c YIELD `date of leaving` AT LEAST c's `counted from` AND `date of leaving` AT MOST c's `counted until`)
                `the components counted for severance`)

-- 1.28.2.3, 2, the principle: every addition recognised as permanent for
-- pension counts, if the employee received it on the eve of leaving.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p25
GIVEN `recognised as permanent for pension` IS A BOOLEAN, `received on the eve of leaving` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an addition counts in the last salary` `recognised as permanent for pension` `received on the eve of leaving` IF
    `recognised as permanent for pension` AND `received on the eve of leaving`

-- The footnote: from 1.1.94 the combined salary includes the stay supplement
-- and the 1993 agreement supplement — which is why (יא) and (כ) end on
-- 31.12.93. The list agrees with it:
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p26
`the components folded into the combined salary on 1.1.94` MEANS
    LIST "stay supplement (תוספת שהייה)", "1993 agreement supplement (תוספת הסכם 1993)"

#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD NOT elem n (`the components counted on` 19940101)) `the components folded into the combined salary on 1.1.94`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD elem n (`the components counted on` 19931231)) `the components folded into the combined salary on 1.1.94`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p28
`the chief labour-relations officer's confirmation of the governing agreement is conclusive` MEANS TRUE

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p29 Item 5 is repealed ("סעיף זה מבוטל"); nothing to encode.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p30
GIVEN `the right depends on a condition met after the end of the relationship` IS A BOOLEAN, `cost-of-living rate on the day the condition is met` IS A NUMBER, `cost-of-living rate on the last day` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the cost-of-living rate the last salary carries` `the right depends on a condition met after the end of the relationship` `cost-of-living rate on the day the condition is met` `cost-of-living rate on the last day` IS
    IF `the right depends on a condition met after the end of the relationship`
    THEN `cost-of-living rate on the day the condition is met`
    ELSE `cost-of-living rate on the last day`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p31
GIVEN `salary as if no temporary change` IS A NUMBER, `salary with the temporary change` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `last salary over a temporary change` `salary as if no temporary change` `salary with the temporary change` IS
    `salary as if no temporary change`

@desc A period of full or part-time work (1.28.2.3, 8).
DECLARE `work period` HAS
    `years in the period`    IS A NUMBER
    `share of a full position` IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p32
GIVEN `full-time salary on the eve of dismissal` IS A NUMBER, periods IS A LIST OF `work period`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `severance over full and part-time periods` `full-time salary on the eve of dismissal` periods IS
    sum (map (GIVEN p YIELD `full-time salary on the eve of dismissal` TIMES p's `share of a full position` TIMES p's `years in the period`) periods)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p33
GIVEN `salary on the eve of the cut` IS A NUMBER, `last salary` IS A NUMBER, `before the cut` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `last salary for a period` `salary on the eve of the cut` `last salary` `before the cut` IS
    IF `before the cut` THEN max `salary on the eve of the cut` `last salary` ELSE `last salary`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p34
GIVEN `pay of the last 12 months` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `last salary for piece-work pay` `pay of the last 12 months` IS
    sum `pay of the last 12 months` DIVIDED BY 12

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p35
GIVEN `unpaid leave under a law` IS A BOOLEAN, `salary had he worked to the dismissal` IS A NUMBER, `salary on the eve of the leave` IS A NUMBER, `cost-of-living rise since the leave` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `last salary after unpaid leave` `unpaid leave under a law` `salary had he worked to the dismissal` `salary on the eve of the leave` `cost-of-living rise since the leave` IS
    -- (א) leave under a law: the salary he would have had on the eve of the dismissal
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p36
    IF `unpaid leave under a law`
    THEN `salary had he worked to the dismissal`
    -- (ב) any other leave: the salary on the eve of the leave, plus the cost-of-living rise since
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p37
    ELSE `salary on the eve of the leave` TIMES (1 PLUS `cost-of-living rise since the leave`)

@desc A period of a year of work that 1.28.2.3, 12 may leave out of the count.
DECLARE `uncounted time in a year` HAS
    `days of military service`             IS A NUMBER
    `days of partial service`              IS A NUMBER
    `days of unpaid leave`                 IS A NUMBER
    `days of it with maternity pay`        IS A NUMBER
    `days of accident or illness`          IS A NUMBER
    `days of it paid as an employee`       IS A NUMBER
    `days of a break "as in the law"`      IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p38
GIVEN u IS A `uncounted time in a year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `days left out of the count` u IS
    -- (א) military service
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p39
        u's `days of military service`
    -- (ב) partial service beyond 120 days
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p40
    PLUS max 0 (u's `days of partial service` MINUS 120)
    -- (ג) unpaid leave beyond 14 days a year, save the days with maternity pay; (ו) maternity leave inside unpaid leave counts
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p41 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p44
    PLUS max 0 (u's `days of unpaid leave` MINUS u's `days of it with maternity pay` MINUS 14)
    -- (ד) accident or illness, save the days paid as an employee, up to 30 a year
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p42
    PLUS max 0 (u's `days of accident or illness` MINUS min (u's `days of it paid as an employee`) 30)
    -- (ה) "a break as in the law" beyond 7 days a year, read under F-1.28-b
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p43
    PLUS max 0 (u's `days of a break "as in the law"` MINUS 7)

-- F-1.28-b: (ה) excludes "a break as in the law" beyond seven days but names
-- no break. The breaks the law (item 2 of 1.28.2.2) lists that (א)-(ד) do
-- not already deal with are many, so the words single out none of them.
`the breaks of item 2 that (א)-(ד) leave unnamed` MEANS
    filter (GIVEN b YIELD `the break keeps continuity` b 3)
        (LIST `weekly rest, a holiday not worked, or 1 May`, `annual leave`, `paid leave or vacation`,
              `strike or lockout`, `days of mourning not worked`,
              `a temporary break without severing the relationship`, `a break severing the relationship`,
              `training for emergency labour service`)

`"a break as in the law" can be more than one break` MEANS
    count `the breaks of item 2 that (א)-(ד) leave unnamed` GREATER THAN 1
#ASSERT `"a break as in the law" can be more than one break`

-- 1.28.2.3, 13-14: a payment to a fund replaces severance only where the
-- governing agreement or the minister says so, and as far as it says; for
-- teachers the minister approved "Mivtachim" for post-primary employees,
-- up to what the fund would pay, save where a pension is due or the next
-- employer undertook the liability within a year.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p45
GIVEN `the agreement or the minister approved it` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a fund payment replaces severance` `the agreement or the minister approved it` IF
    `the agreement or the minister approved it`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p46 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p47 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p48
GIVEN `severance due` IS A NUMBER, `what Mivtachim would pay` IS A NUMBER, `pension from the fund` IS A BOOLEAN, `next employer's undertaking within a year` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `severance still owed by a post-primary employer` `severance due` `what Mivtachim would pay` `pension from the fund` `next employer's undertaking within a year` IS
    IF
        -- (1) a pension from the fund
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p49
        `pension from the fund`
        -- (2) the next employer's written undertaking, delivered within a year
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p50
        OR `next employer's undertaking within a year`
    THEN 0
    ELSE max 0 (`severance due` MINUS `what Mivtachim would pay`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p51
GIVEN `a pension is due by law` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the pension replaces severance` `a pension is due by law` IF `a pension is due by law`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p52 Items 15-18 are repealed ("סעיפים אלו מבוטלים"); nothing to encode.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p53
`a collective agreement may set how severance is paid, deposits included` MEANS TRUE

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p54 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p55
DECLARE `deposit order` HAS
    `employer kinds it covers`  IS A STRING
    `published on`              IS A NUMBER
    `in force from`             IS A NUMBER

GIVEN o IS A `deposit order`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the deposit order is valid` o IF
    o's `in force from` AT LEAST o's `published on`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p56
DECLARE `matter of deposit regulations` IS ONE OF
    -- (1) how deposited money is invested
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p57
    `investing the money`
    -- (2) how and by what procedure the severance is paid out
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p58
    `paying out the severance`
    -- (3) the money where the fund's approval lapses or the fund is wound up
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p59
    `the money of a lapsed or wound-up fund`
    -- (4) raising the deposits for late deposit
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p60
    `raising late deposits`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p61 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p62
`deposits are collected as a tax under the Taxes (Collection) Ordinance, save its section 12` MEANS TRUE

-- 1.28.2.3, 24: deposit within 42 days of paying the salary of the period;
-- the minister may extend by up to 3 months (time in days).
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p63
GIVEN `days of extension` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.28 party` `termination action`
DECIDE `depositing under a deposit order` `days of extension` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `deposit severance savings` d PROVIDED d AT MOST 42 PLUS min `days of extension` 90
    WITHIN 42 PLUS min `days of extension` 90
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "1.28.2.3(24): deposits are due within 42 days of paying the salary"

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p64 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p65 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p66 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p67
GIVEN `the employee left on terms that earn severance` IS A BOOLEAN, `also for an annuity and not returnable by agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the deposited sums may be returned, assigned, pledged or attached` `the employee left on terms that earn severance` `also for an annuity and not returnable by agreement` IF
    (NOT `the employee left on terms that earn severance`) AND (NOT `also for an annuity and not returnable by agreement`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p66
`deposited sums are part of the employer's assets on death, bankruptcy or winding-up while claims are unpaid` MEANS FALSE

-- 1.28.2.3, 26: in bankruptcy or winding-up, severance ranks as wages with
-- priority, the two together up to 150% of the wage ceiling of priority.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p68 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p69
GIVEN `wages owed` IS A NUMBER, `severance owed` IS A NUMBER, `the priority ceiling for wages` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `wages and severance with priority` `wages owed` `severance owed` `the priority ceiling for wages` IS
    min (`wages owed` PLUS `severance owed`) (1.5 TIMES `the priority ceiling for wages`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p70
GIVEN `the minister approved the agreement` IS A BOOLEAN, `a collective agreement requires severance` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `severance included in the wage replaces the law` `the minister approved the agreement` `a collective agreement requires severance` IF
    `the minister approved the agreement` AND (NOT `a collective agreement requires severance`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p71
GIVEN `in writing` IS A BOOLEAN, `says expressly it is about severance` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a settlement or waiver of severance is valid` `in writing` `says expressly it is about severance` IF
    `in writing` AND `says expressly it is about severance`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p72
`the state is an employer like any other` MEANS TRUE

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p73
`the law takes away a right under another law, agreement, contract or custom` MEANS FALSE

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p74 Heading "מועד תשלום הפיצויים"; its rules follow.

@desc The dates that 1.28.2.3's "date for paying severance" is the latest of; 0 where a date does not arise.
DECLARE `severance dates` HAS
    `end of the relationship`             IS A NUMBER
    `date set by a collective arrangement or extension order` IS A NUMBER
    `date set by a contract granting more than the law` IS A NUMBER
    `date a right after the end was set`  IS A NUMBER
    `date a condition after the end was met` IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p75
GIVEN s IS A `severance dates`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the date for paying severance` s IS
    maximum (LIST
        -- (א) the day the relationship ended
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p76
        s's `end of the relationship`,
        -- (ב) the date a collective agreement, arrangement or extension order sets
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p77
        s's `date set by a collective arrangement or extension order`,
        -- (ג) for a right above the statutory one, the date its contract sets, or the day the right was set
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p78
        s's `date set by a contract granting more than the law`,
        -- (ד) a right set collectively after the end with no date: the day it was set
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p79
        s's `date a right after the end was set`,
        -- (ה) a right conditional on something after the end: the day the condition is met
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p80
        s's `date a condition after the end was met`)

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p81 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p85 Amendment notes ("חוק (מס' 16) תשמ"ה - 1985"); no rule.

-- 1.28.2.3, payment 2(ב): severance is late after 15 days. Paid on days
-- 16-30: indexation from the due date. After day 30: indexation plus 20% of
-- the whole for every month late, a part of a month pro rata. The months are
-- counted from the due date, as the text says ("בעד כל חודש שבו לא שולמו").
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p82 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p83 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p84
GIVEN `severance` IS A NUMBER, `days late` IS A NUMBER, `indexation` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `late-payment compensation` `severance` `days late` `indexation` IS
    BRANCH IF `days late` AT MOST 15 THEN 0
           IF `days late` AT MOST 30 THEN `indexation`
           OTHERWISE `indexation` PLUS (`severance` PLUS `indexation`) TIMES 0.2 TIMES (`days late` DIVIDED BY 30)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p86
`the late-payment compensation is part of the severance` MEANS TRUE

-- 1.28.2.3, payment 3: save for one entitled under sections 1(א) or 5 of
-- the law, the due date does not run until a written demand stating the
-- ground reached the employer; a later demand moves it to the demand's day.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p87
GIVEN `entitled under section 1(א) or 5` IS A BOOLEAN, `the date for paying` IS A NUMBER, `day of the written demand` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the date for paying after a demand` `entitled under section 1(א) or 5` `the date for paying` `day of the written demand` IS
    IF `entitled under section 1(א) or 5`
    THEN `the date for paying`
    ELSE max `the date for paying` `day of the written demand`

-- 1.28.2.3, payment 4: the court may reduce or cancel the late-payment
-- compensation "as in section 18", also where the severance was held back
-- for one of these. Read under F-1.28-a.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p88
DECLARE `reason severance was held back` IS ONE OF
    -- (א) a real dispute over the right itself
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p89
    `a real dispute over the right`
    -- (ב) a dispute over the day the relationship ended
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p90
    `a dispute over the end date`
    -- (ג) the claimant withheld particulars the employer asked for
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p91
    `particulars withheld from the employer`
    `another reason`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p88
GIVEN r IS A `reason severance was held back`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the court may also reduce or cancel the compensation for` r IF
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `another reason` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

-- F-1.28-a: payment 4 applies "sections 17א, 18 and 19 of the law"; in this
-- section "the law" is the Severance Pay Law (note 16 of 1.28.2.2, used so in
-- every source note of 1.28.2.3), while the clause comes from the Wage
-- Protection Law (its own note, 59), whose sections those are.
`the law "החוק" names in 1.28.2` MEANS "Severance Pay Law 1963"
`the law payment 4 is taken from` MEANS "Wage Protection Law"
`"sections 17א, 18 and 19 of the law" point into a law the clause is not from` MEANS
    NOT (`the law "החוק" names in 1.28.2` EQUALS `the law payment 4 is taken from`)
#ASSERT `"sections 17א, 18 and 19 of the law" point into a law the clause is not from`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p92
GIVEN `the employer told the fund in writing it consents` IS A BOOLEAN, `days from the due date to that notice` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `no late-payment compensation on what the fund owes` `the employer told the fund in writing it consents` `days from the due date to that notice` IF
    `the employer told the fund in writing it consents` AND `days from the due date to that notice` AT MOST 60

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p93
GIVEN `day of deposit in the court` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `day a deceased's severance counts as paid` `day of deposit in the court` IS `day of deposit in the court`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p94 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p95 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p96 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p97 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p98 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p99 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p100 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p101 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p102 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p103 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p104 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p105 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p106 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p107 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p108 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p109 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p110 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p111 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p112 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p113 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p114 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p115 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p116 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p117 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p118 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p119 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p120 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p121 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p122 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p123 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p124 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p125 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p126 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p127 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p128 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p129 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p130 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p131 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p132 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p133 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p134 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p135 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p136 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p137 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p138 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_3/p139 The sources of 1.28.2.3 (אסמכתא): per item, sections of the Severance Pay Law and its regulations, and per salary component the agreement or circular that made it count.

§§ `1.28.2.4 פיצויי פיטורין לעובדי ממשלת ירדן או עריית ירושלים העתיקה`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_4__para_1
`the Civil Service Commissioner sets the rules for former Jordanian and old-Jerusalem employees` MEANS TRUE

@desc A state employee once employed by the Jordanian government or the old Jerusalem municipality.
DECLARE `former Jordanian employee` HAS
    `employed by Jordan or the municipality just before 7.6.67, in a service Israel now gives` IS A BOOLEAN
    `joined the Israeli service by`        IS A NUMBER @desc year-month-day
    `leaves without a pension`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `entitled to severance for the Israeli service alone` IS A BOOLEAN
    `severance by the Jordanian rules of 1.6.67` IS A NUMBER @desc the Jordanian rules and conditions on the basic salary of the time; an input
    `severance by the Severance Pay Law for the Israeli service` IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_4__para_2
GIVEN e IS A `former Jordanian employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is an "employee" of 1.28.2.4` e IF
    -- employed just before 7.6.67 and taken into the Israeli service by 15.5.69
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_4__para_2/p2
    e's `employed by Jordan or the municipality just before 7.6.67, in a service Israel now gives`
    AND e's `joined the Israeli service by` AT MOST 19690515

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_4__para_2/p3 Defines "the Pensions Law" as the Civil Service (Pensions) Law 1955, which 1.28.2.4 then does not use; no rule.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_4__para_3
GIVEN e IS A `former Jordanian employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `severance of a former Jordanian employee` e IS
    IF `is an "employee" of 1.28.2.4` e AND e's `leaves without a pension` AND e's `entitled to severance for the Israeli service alone`
    THEN    -- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_4__para_3__subpara_a (א) the Jordanian service, by the Jordanian rules of 1.6.67
            e's `severance by the Jordanian rules of 1.6.67`
            -- (ב) the Israeli service, by the Severance Pay Law
            @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_4__para_3__subpara_b
       PLUS e's `severance by the Severance Pay Law for the Israeli service`
    ELSE 0

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_4__para_4
GIVEN `years in Jordan` IS A NUMBER, `years in Israel` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `service counted for the Jordanian severance` `years in Jordan` `years in Israel` IS
    `years in Jordan` PLUS `years in Israel`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_4/p1 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_2_4/p2 The source of 1.28.2.4 (אסמכתא): a Civil Service Commission circular of 1969.

§§ `1.28.3 הפסקה זמנית`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_3/p1 Amendment note ("סעיף זה עודכן ב-26.5.2002"); no rule.

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_3__para_1 Heading "1. הפסקה זמנית מטעמי עברות משמעת"; its rules follow.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_3__para_1/p2 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_3__para_1/p3
GIVEN `in official education` IS A BOOLEAN, `date` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the rules of a disciplinary suspension` `in official education` `date` IS
    IF `in official education` AND `date` AT LEAST 19730201
    THEN "the Civil Service (Discipline) Law 1963"
    ELSE "the ownership's own usual procedure"

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_3__para_2 Heading "2. הפסקה זמנית מטעמים פדגוגיים"; its rule follows.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_3__para_2/p2
GIVEN `an urgent need to stop the work on educational grounds` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.28 party` `termination action`
DECIDE `a pedagogical suspension` `an urgent need to stop the work on educational grounds` IS
    IF `an urgent need to stop the work on educational grounds`
    THEN PARTY `the director-general` MAY `suspend the teacher for pedagogical reasons`
    ELSE PARTY `the director-general` SHANT `suspend the teacher for pedagogical reasons`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_3/p2 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_3/p3 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_3/p4 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_3/p5 The sources of 1.28.3 (אסמכתא).

§§ `1.28.4 זניחת מקום העבודה`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_4/p1 Introduces the summary of a National Labour Court judgment that follows.

@desc An absence from work, as the judgment asks about it.
DECLARE `absence` HAS
    `is a "political strike"`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `prolonged`                             IS A BOOLEAN
    `pointless to ask the employer to take disciplinary steps towards dismissal` IS A BOOLEAN
    `special circumstances the employee pleads` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_4__para_1 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_4__para_2
GIVEN a IS A `absence`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the absence has the protection of a strike` a IF
    (NOT a's `is a "political strike"`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_4__para_3 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_4__para_3/p2
DECLARE `way an employment relationship ends` IS ONE OF
    `dismissal, the king's road`
    `resignation, the king's road`
    `liquidation of the enterprise, a path for the employer`
    `abandonment, a path for the employee`

-- 1.28.4(4)-(5), (7): abandonment ends the relationship in some circumstances
-- only — a prolonged absence going beyond a disciplinary breach, where it is
-- pointless to ask the employer to take steps to dismiss; the intention is
-- learned from the result, not from a declaration.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_4__para_4 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_4__para_5 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_4__para_7
GIVEN a IS A `absence`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the absence is abandonment of the work` a IF
        a's `prolonged`
    AND a's `pointless to ask the employer to take disciplinary steps towards dismissal`
    AND (NOT `the absence has the protection of a strike` a)

-- 1.28.4(6): the court gives weight to the "special" sparingly. The text
-- gives no measure; the court's weighing is an input.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_4__para_6
GIVEN a IS A `absence`, `the court finds the special circumstances outweigh` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `abandonment after weighing the special` a `the court finds the special circumstances outweigh` IF
    `the absence is abandonment of the work` a
    AND ((NOT a's `special circumstances the employee pleads`) OR (NOT `the court finds the special circumstances outweigh`))

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_4__para_8 The outcome of the case summarised (the two employees abandoned their work); it decides that case and states no further rule.

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_4/p2 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_28__ssec_1_28_4/p3 The source of 1.28.4 (אסמכתא): the judgment of 2.7.84 as published in a director-general circular.

-- Worked examples. All figures are placeholders, not from any case.
`twenty years, monthly pay` MEANS
    `severance basis` WITH
        `paid monthly`                    IS TRUE
        `last monthly salary`             IS 10000
        `last weekly wage`                IS 0
        `years after 1 January 1964`      IS 20
        `years before 1 January 1964`     IS 0
        `share of the last salary for the years before 1964` IS 0.8

#ASSERT `severance pay` `twenty years, monthly pay` EQUALS 200000
#ASSERT `late-payment compensation` 100000 10 500 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `late-payment compensation` 100000 20 500 EQUALS 500
#ASSERT `months beyond 35 years` 456 62 20100101 EQUALS 36
#ASSERT `the break keeps continuity` `a break severing the relationship` 2
#ASSERT `the takanon sections on dismissal at` `management posts` EQUALS LIST "7.3.4", "7.6.4"
#EVAL   `the components counted on` 20100101

-- Resignation notice for work to stop in month 10 (June of a school year
-- counted from September): given in month 7, in time.
#TRACE `notice of resignation` 10 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the teacher` DOES `give notice of resignation` 7 AT 7

-- School closure: talks opened on 5 April (day 95), in time; none by 31 May, a breach.
#TRACE `talks before closing a school` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the ownership` DOES `open talks with the teachers' unions` 95 AT 95
#TRACE `talks before closing a school` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the ownership` DOES `open talks with the teachers' unions` 160 AT 160
